%% Provider selection is immutable after installation activation.
stateDiagram-v2
    state "Active / Provider Locked" as ActiveProviderLocked

    [*] --> Unconfigured: start installation
    Unconfigured --> ProviderSelected: choose AWS or Azure
    ProviderSelected --> Simulation: choose simulation mode
    ProviderSelected --> Sandbox: choose sandbox mode
    ProviderSelected --> Enterprise: choose enterprise mode
    Simulation --> ActiveProviderLocked: activate simulation installation
    Sandbox --> ActiveProviderLocked: activate sandbox installation
    Enterprise --> ActiveProviderLocked: activate enterprise installation
    ActiveProviderLocked --> ActiveProviderLocked: submit provider-matching request
    ActiveProviderLocked --> Rejected: request uses other provider
    ActiveProviderLocked --> Rejected: attempt to change provider
    Rejected --> ActiveProviderLocked: correct request
    ActiveProviderLocked --> [*]: retire installation
